  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "机甲可构筑为远程狙击轻型、导弹步枪均衡型或激光刃霰弹重装冲锋型",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Do you prefer a light and mobile mech that bombards their foes from range with a trusty sniper? How about a well-rounded powerhouse who focuses on bringing the pain with missile bombardments and automatic rifles? Or maybe you prefer a tanky build that barrels through all opposition with laser blades and shotguns?",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3180340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每次失败都会带回新部件，且每个零件由不同完整套装的组件重新组合生成",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In RIG Riot, every loss is an opportunity. Dive into the garage and check out the exciting new parts you've earned. Every part in RIG Riot is made out of a combination of components from the various full sets available in the game.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3180340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "稀有武器与易爆模组需要围绕当前机甲效果互补，形成高难阶段协同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Search for rare weapons and mods with effects that compliment your build to see just how far you can go.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3180340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
